  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "14.3.1 - Language fallback: selecting a base language code (e.g. \"sv\", \"fi\") now correctly resolves the matching regional language file (e.g. sv-SE.xml, fi-FI.xml) instead of falling back to English.\n\n14.3.0 - Server-side thumbnail URL generation using IImageUrlGenerator. Thumbnail URLs are no longer constructed client-side.\n\n14.2.1 - Added support for SVG/vector files from the Mediaflow FileSelector.\n\n14.2.0 - Server-side OAuth token exchange. Credentials are no longer exposed to the browser.\n\n14.1.0 - Appsettings config, usage report fix, Delivery API support, translations. Supports all Umbraco 14.x versions.\n\n1.0 - Dotnet core version",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
